{"id":"d6de86836bb719f3","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements.md","title":"Definition — 预层的元素范畴","display":"Definition — 预层的元素范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements"],"display":"Definition — 预层的元素范畴","source_ref":"I.5, pp.40–41","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层的元素范畴"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.5, pp.40–41"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P:\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴。下式把箭头记为带源、靶的三元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_P\">\\(\\pi_P\\)</span> 为投影函子。</p>\n<p>本条箭头三元组顺序固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\text{源对象},\\text{底层箭头},\\text{靶对象})\">\\((\\text{源对象},\\text{底层箭头},\\text{靶对象})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P\">\\(s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P\\)</span> 是以下六元组的结构映射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}\">\\(\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}\\)</span> 是投影函子的对象、箭头映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int_{\\mathcal C}P)=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int_{\\mathcal C}P)=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\int P}((D,q),(C,p))=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\int P}((D,q),(C,p))=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{(C,p)}=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{id}_{(C,p)}=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((D,q),v,(E,r))\\circ_{\\int P}((C,p),u,(D,q))=((C,p),v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,(E,r)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((D,q),v,(E,r))\\circ_{\\int P}((C,p),u,(D,q))=((C,p),v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,(E,r)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_P(C,p)=C,\\qquad\\pi_P(((D,q),u,(C,p)))=u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_P(C,p)=C,\\qquad\\pi_P(((D,q),u,(C,p)))=u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{P,0}:=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\},\\qquad E_{P,1}:=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid(D,q),(C,p)\\in E_{P,0}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{P,0}:=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\},\\qquad E_{P,1}:=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid(D,q),(C,p)\\in E_{P,0}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_P(a,u,b):=a,\\quad t_P(a,u,b):=b,\\quad i_P(C,p):=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),\\quad c_P((b,v,c),(a,u,b)):=(a,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_P(a,u,b):=a,\\quad t_P(a,u,b):=b,\\quad i_P(C,p):=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),\\quad c_P((b,v,c),(a,u,b)):=(a,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\int_{\\mathcal C}P:=(E_{P,0},E_{P,1},s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P),\\qquad\\pi_{P,0}(C,p):=C,\\qquad\\pi_{P,1}((D,q),u,(C,p)):=u,\\qquad\\pi_P:=(\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\int_{\\mathcal C}P:=(E_{P,0},E_{P,1},s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P),\\qquad\\pi_{P,0}(C,p):=C,\\qquad\\pi_{P,1}((D,q),u,(C,p)):=u,\\qquad\\pi_P:=(\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>箭头带标签使定义域、值域无歧义；复合箭头仍满足元素条件，由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(vu)=P(u)P(v)\">\\(P(vu)=P(u)P(v)\\)</span> 保证。恒等和结合律继承自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>。对象和箭头由小并组成，故元素范畴小。这里使用的是反变预层的元素范畴；协变平坦函子的元素范畴涉及相反的箭头约定，不能混用过滤方向。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.5, pp.40–41。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P:\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_P","display":false},{"tex":"(\\text{源对象},\\text{底层箭头},\\text{靶对象})","display":false},{"tex":"s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int_{\\mathcal C}P)=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\int P}((D,q),(C,p))=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_{(C,p)}=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),","display":true},{"tex":"((D,q),v,(E,r))\\circ_{\\int P}((C,p),u,(D,q))=((C,p),v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,(E,r)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_P(C,p)=C,\\qquad\\pi_P(((D,q),u,(C,p)))=u.","display":true},{"tex":"E_{P,0}:=\\{(C,p)\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in P(C)\\},\\qquad E_{P,1}:=\\{((D,q),u,(C,p))\\mid(D,q),(C,p)\\in E_{P,0}\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\land P(u)p=q\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s_P(a,u,b):=a,\\quad t_P(a,u,b):=b,\\quad i_P(C,p):=((C,p),\\operatorname{id}_C,(C,p)),\\quad c_P((b,v,c),(a,u,b)):=(a,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u,c).","display":true},{"tex":"\\int_{\\mathcal C}P:=(E_{P,0},E_{P,1},s_P,t_P,i_P,c_P),\\qquad\\pi_{P,0}(C,p):=C,\\qquad\\pi_{P,1}((D,q),u,(C,p)):=u,\\qquad\\pi_P:=(\\pi_{P,0},\\pi_{P,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"P(vu)=P(u)P(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":2474,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements|df-195 — 预层的元素范畴]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements|df-195 — 预层的元素范畴]]"},{"id":"717547fac08fc31f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}